  "2026-08-30T15:02:44.071Z",pi-agent,"Evidence: npm run changelog:full wrote CHANGELOG.md. npm run changelog:check reported: Changelog is up to date. The diff moves the two stale fixes under 2026.8.29, retains this repair item under Unreleased, and adds only this item's tracking files."
